those who rated themselves high unhappy

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:02.550
would also rate themselves high on
social and those who rated themselves

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:08.100
low unhappy would also rate themselves
low on social and by looking at those

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:12.660
patterns of covariation you can
determine what the essential dimensions

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:19.500
are of human personality one of the
dimensions is roughly happiness that's

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:25.440
extraversion another dimension is
neuroticism it's a negative emotion

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:31.680
